Z||000013||ChadMan||07-25-2000||08:05 PM||||Hey Roger, did you have your car at the Len Immke show for arthritis a couple of weeks ago?  If so, thank you - you got me a free beer.  My buddy asked why your car wasn't with the other Ferraris, and I told him it was a Fiero rebody.  He thought I was full of dung, so I bet him a beer.  When he agreed, I flipped over the "Big Fiero Parts Book" you had in your trunk.  He just swore and started walking toward the beer trailer.  Wasn't that an amazing show?  Could you believe they had not one, but TWO gen-yoo-wine Ferrari F40s there, plus a yellow Diablo with the targa top?<P>Your car is beautiful, by the way.||||reg||1
