Z||000022||rogergarrison||07-27-2000||06:03 PM||||Thanks Chad. I spent lots of time and cash making mine as accurate as possible. That was me at the Imkee show with the GT-40 beside me (also a Kit) I even got real Ferrari seat skins and wheels. It was really funny when I came in all the REAL Ferrari guys directed me into the parking area with them, lol. Then they looked in the engine cmpt while I was setting up. They asked me to move down with other kits-no problem with me- then for the ultimate insult when i left i was right beside a real 308. They have 225HP and I have closer to 300 and I dusted him. What an ego boost for me. hope to see you at Louisville.<P>rg||||reg||1
