Z||000026||Dan||07-28-2000||09:12 PM|||| Yep. I'll be there.I'm driving an 86 Silver SE, and my daughters boyfriend is driving an 88 Black formula.Not showing.<P>Ramada Inn<BR>700 Riverside Drive<BR>Jeffersonville, Indiana<BR>phone number (800)537-3612<P>.........."When you register for the Festival it is to pay<BR>for entering your car into the car show which is on Saturday. The banquet<BR>is on Sat night and that is where the car show awards are given out.<BR>Thursday is registration and classification of your car. Thurs night I<BR>think there is going to be a local cruise. Friday at 12:00 we all go onto<BR>the riverboat for a cruise down/up the river (we'll have discount coupons at<BR>registration) and Friday night will be the hospitality room with Fiero hot<BR>wheel races etc.<P>We would love to have you join us. Registration is $45.00 which includes<BR>goodie bag, dash plack and t-shirt. Banquet is $25.00 per person and you<BR>have to make your own reservations at the hotel. Riverside Ramada Inn 800<BR>537-3612 or 812-283-3686 you have to mention 262Y to get the special rate<BR>of $60.00. If you plan on going we need to know so you will not be charged<BR>a late fee." -<BR>||||reg||1
